重要声明 / IMPORTANT NOTICE:

本项目是基于罗伯特·海因莱因（Robert A. Heinlein）短篇小说
《你们这些还魂尸》("All You Zombies", 1959) 的原创同人改编，
为非商业性质的粉丝作品，谨向原作致敬。

原著小说的版权归罗伯特·海因莱因及其合法权利人所有。本许可
仅覆盖本项目的原创改编内容，不授予对原著小说本身的任何权利。

This project is an original fan adaptation based on Robert A.
Heinlein's short story "All You Zombies" (1959). It is a non-commercial
fan work made in tribute to the original.

The copyright of the original story belongs to Robert A. Heinlein and
his lawful rights holders. This license covers only the original
adaptation content of this project and grants no rights to the
original story itself.

